1
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:03,260
Mess 'em up good, boys!

2
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,420
Clear a path for me, and be quick!

3
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,080
Watch out, you guys!

4
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,220
He's gearing up!

5
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,580
Ice Ball!

6
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:45,100
Wait, it's a Popsicle!

7
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,300
We got him!

8
00:00:57,760 --> 00:00:58,937
We broke out.

9
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:02,320
Those vibrations can't
be frozen. Tough luck.

10
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:05,090
Ice!

11
00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:11,560
Admiral Kuzan!

12
00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:13,380
He's been stabbed!

13
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,934
To thou keep you dead!

14
00:01:21,540 --> 00:01:22,370
No!

15
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,820
Doing fine, thank you.

16
00:01:29,420 --> 00:01:31,740
Go, Icelock! Partison!

17
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:54,180
Go! I'll fight!

18
00:01:54,820 --> 00:01:56,340
I'm counting on you, son.

19
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:03,600
I had him. Damn.

20
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:13,800
Don't stop moving.

21
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,118
We're almost there.

22
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:23,077
The scaffold is straight ahead, but first
we need to break through these cracks.

23
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,840
Hurry up and die!

24
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:28,180
You and the rest of
the filthy pirate scum!

25
00:02:38,540 --> 00:02:40,020
I must!

26
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:18,060
Every time the rain no longer falls.

27
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:20,197
And I see the sky.

28
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:23,177
I think back to when I was a child.

29
00:03:23,260 --> 00:03:25,817
Who could only cry.

30
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:28,497
Blindly chasing after him.

31
00:03:28,580 --> 00:03:33,137
I fell far behind my only thought.

32
00:03:33,220 --> 00:03:36,237
One day I will be stronger.

33
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:38,797
Marjorie and gratitude.

34
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:41,297
Fading with the wind.

35
00:03:41,380 --> 00:03:44,197
Am I stronger now than I was before?

36
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:46,177
Or as weak as back then?

37
00:03:46,260 --> 00:03:48,217
I don't know for sure.

38
00:03:48,300 --> 00:03:52,037
But until I do, my voyage will not end.

39
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:57,160
No matter what's next, I'm
walking straight ahead.

40
00:03:58,320 --> 00:04:03,437
So let's go, there's nothing
that can stop us now.

41
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:08,440
Those times are on our side,
we'll never let it pull us down.

42
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:13,457
And we may fall, but we'll
always keep on standing.

43
00:04:13,540 --> 00:04:18,060
There's no way anything
will take what I hope.

44
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:24,537
The voices inside me push
me to keep surviving.

45
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:30,137
I'll go on, I'll get through,
no matter what I gotta do.

46
00:04:30,220 --> 00:04:34,077
The fiercest of the ball can pour upon me.

47
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:38,940
I don't care why in the
world would I turn back.

48
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:47,820
So let's go, there's
nothing that can stop.

49
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:53,697
Though time's not on our side,
we'll never let it pull us down.

50
00:04:53,780 --> 00:04:58,757
And we may fall, but we'll
always keep on standing.

51
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:04,957
There's no way anything will take
what I hold dear away from me.

52
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:08,540
I know the future's there for us to see.

53
00:05:23,700 --> 00:05:29,820
Straw Hat Luffy, I, Momonga, am the
Navy Vice Admiral who will cut you down.

54
00:05:30,060 --> 00:05:31,360
It ends here.

55
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:34,240
Vice Admiral, the same rank as Grandpa.

56
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:35,710
Shave.

57
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:37,980
Move off.

58
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:50,920
Second year!

59
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:54,880
You're finished, Drawhead!

60
00:05:55,180 --> 00:05:56,100
Finger Pistol!

61
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:26,520
Garp, don't you dare forget
whose side you're on.

62
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:53,140
You're full of courage, aren't you?

63
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:55,860
But take this word of advice.

64
00:06:56,340 --> 00:07:00,537
If you're simply not strong enough,
no matter how courageous you may be,

65
00:07:00,620 --> 00:07:02,973
you won't even come close to saving him.

66
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,760
Kill Whitebeard!

67
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,520
Keep pushing him back!

68
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,900
Why don't you just give up?

69
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:31,870
Hey!

70
00:07:32,060 --> 00:07:33,295
That's Ace's brother!

71
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:34,730
Ace!

72
00:07:41,780 --> 00:07:42,610
Huh.

73
00:07:42,693 --> 00:07:46,700
Well, seems the white beard brand
is losing some of its punch.

74
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:52,357
Surely you could have done better than
let that youngster lead the attack.

75
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,820
I mean, look at him.

76
00:07:55,460 --> 00:07:57,300
The boy is hardly breathing.

77
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:59,642
Guess that's partially my fault.

78
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:05,500
Say, Pops, let's block the beam!

79
00:08:05,740 --> 00:08:07,460
What a devoted crew.

80
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,640
I've spotted him!

81
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:10,700
Straw boy!

82
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:13,720
Right over there, Team Bay! Huh?

83
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:15,240
Who's that?

84
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:17,080
And where is it coming from?

85
00:08:19,660 --> 00:08:21,060
Just as I suspected.

86
00:08:21,380 --> 00:08:24,380
Didn't I tell you Luffy
was going to be in trouble?

87
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:25,940
What the?

88
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:28,101
That face, why is it so gigantic?

89
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:30,457
I don't know, I think it just does that.

90
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:31,370
Luffy!

91
00:08:31,453 --> 00:08:33,400
Is he still alive? Say something!

92
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:36,100
Oh, easy does it! Ah!

93
00:08:40,020 --> 00:08:41,140
Get off!

94
00:08:43,940 --> 00:08:46,820
You are wasting our time! Sorry.

95
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:51,120
I think this little Fall belongs to you.

96
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:56,900
Eva, Jinbei, let me go!

97
00:08:57,220 --> 00:08:59,200
Oh, man, let go of my legs!

98
00:08:59,340 --> 00:09:01,180
I'm so close to him! Let go!

99
00:09:02,300 --> 00:09:03,130
Enough.

100
00:09:03,213 --> 00:09:04,937
He's done his fair share of good.

101
00:09:05,020 --> 00:09:07,317
Treat him. No! Get off!

102
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,597
I don't have time for this!

103
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:09,920
Get away! Let me go!

104
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:12,177
They're gonna...

105
00:09:12,260 --> 00:09:13,090
I gotta...

106
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:17,380
Koza needs me! Please!

107
00:09:17,860 --> 00:09:19,120
He's my only brother!

108
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:20,137
I can't lose him!

109
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:21,050
I can't!

110
00:09:21,133 --> 00:09:21,963
I'd rather die!

111
00:09:22,046 --> 00:09:23,040
At any cost!

112
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:25,060
I gotta... I promise...

113
00:09:25,700 --> 00:09:26,530
I will...

114
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:29,000
I'll save him!

115
00:09:36,340 --> 00:09:37,660
Ate him quick!

116
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:39,460
He's in bad shape.

117
00:09:39,740 --> 00:09:40,570
Please, Sergeant!

118
00:09:40,653 --> 00:09:43,340
Do everything within
your power to help him.

119
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:45,180
Luffy, can you hear me?

120
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:46,755
Stay with us, friend!

121
00:09:49,300 --> 00:09:52,937
He's nothing but a big-mouthed
kid who goes looking for trouble.

122
00:09:53,020 --> 00:09:55,040
Dumb and clumsy. Careless, too.

123
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:02,060
But I've got a soft
spot for fools like him.

124
00:10:05,780 --> 00:10:07,260
Ha ha ha ha ha!

125
00:10:08,220 --> 00:10:11,620
If you're ready to die,
step up and meet your maker!

126
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,940
Oh no! Not again!

127
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:32,240
You, you're always sailing
around wreaking havoc.

128
00:10:32,540 --> 00:10:34,300
But here, you're through!

129
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:44,420
That's what you think I'll be right back
you wait here hold on you're leaving

130
00:10:45,380 --> 00:10:48,540
I must I won't rest until Ace is safe

131
00:11:02,260 --> 00:11:05,120
Stay away from him it's too dangerous

132
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,550
Die!

133
00:11:10,633 --> 00:11:11,463
Damn you!

134
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:26,750
Move it.

135
00:11:26,833 --> 00:11:28,560
Pops is coming through.

136
00:11:29,060 --> 00:11:30,640
You think yourself brave,

137
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:35,096
but if you had any pride as swordsman,
you'd know when to admit defeat.

138
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,230
Move!

139
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:44,600
Insolent wretches.

140
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:49,537
Luffy, I shall smite every
man that stands between us!

141
00:11:49,620 --> 00:11:50,957
I'm coming, my love.

142
00:11:51,040 --> 00:11:52,497
She's attacking both sides.

143
00:11:52,580 --> 00:11:54,597
Boa Hancock's completely lost it.

144
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:56,680
Everyone cover your eyes, quickly!

145
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:05,280
Slave arrows.

146
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:17,640
Lovely, the corpse
count's still on the rise.

147
00:12:34,700 --> 00:12:36,880
Quit moving around! You're mine!

148
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:39,620
Am I?

149
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:41,938
It sure feels like I'm roaming free.

150
00:12:46,140 --> 00:12:48,020
It's not over yet.

151
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:51,340
Keep on the alert, man.

152
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:56,837
Those are the new world pirates
that were trapped in the bay.

153
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:58,697
Sorry for the wait.

154
00:12:58,780 --> 00:13:00,797
Nice about time!

155
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,077
Just great.

156
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:04,777
We turned away for one
second and this happens.

157
00:13:04,860 --> 00:13:07,117
Uncle is not gonna like this.

158
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:08,457
We better clean up.

159
00:13:08,540 --> 00:13:09,797
So get ready.

160
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:11,677
Show no mercy to our enemies.

161
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:15,137
And it's fine if a few soldiers
get caught up in the crossfire.

162
00:13:15,220 --> 00:13:17,020
Fire Pacifistas.

163
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:28,740
Hang on, Ace.

164
00:13:28,940 --> 00:13:30,058
I'm coming for you.

165
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:36,620
He's flying!

166
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:38,077
What are you winning, Mark?

167
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:39,042
Shoot him down!

168
00:13:42,220 --> 00:13:44,102
It's going straight through him!

169
00:13:44,340 --> 00:13:45,380
Never mind that!

170
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:46,678
Just keep shooting!

171
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,660
What's the big idea?

172
00:14:13,860 --> 00:14:16,331
I never gave you orders to start fighting!

173
00:14:17,020 --> 00:14:17,850
We're doomed!

174
00:14:17,933 --> 00:14:19,840
We have to fight Monkey D. Garp!

175
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:21,580
This can't be good.

176
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:23,380
The legendary Navy hero!

177
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:26,300
Life cycle, Garp!

178
00:14:28,940 --> 00:14:31,180
We got this now! They're finished!

179
00:14:31,420 --> 00:14:33,420
He's the best gatekeeper there is!

180
00:14:34,060 --> 00:14:34,890
Oh, man.

181
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:37,670
Garp.

182
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:43,377
If you want to reach the scaffold, you're
gonna have to make it through me first!

183
00:14:43,460 --> 00:14:46,660
Stupid brats.
